# Trivy vulnerability ignore list.
#
# Add entries here only for confirmed false positives or vulnerabilities that
# are genuinely not exploitable in this image (e.g. the vulnerable code path is
# never reached). Do NOT use this file to silence real findings — CRITICAL
# severities fail the "docker" CI job by design (see .github/workflows/ci.yml).
#
# Format: one CVE (or GHSA) ID per line, optionally with a trailing comment.
# Example:
# CVE-2023-12345 # base-image glibc CVE, not reachable — process never parses untrusted locale data
